{
  "name": "CJGRKit",
  "version": "0.2.8",
  "summary": "可进行各种手势(缩放、拖动(含位置调整))的基于UIView或UIScrollView的视图基类",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/dvlproad/CJGRKit.git",
  "license": {
    "type": "Copyright",
    "text": "              © 2008-2020 dvlproad. All rights reserved.\n"
  },
  "authors": {
    "dvlproad": ""
  },
  "description": "各种手势，可按需独立引入：\n• CJGRKit/CGRectCJSubHelper - 一个调整小区域的frame使其保持在cage内部，或调整大区域的frame使其包含住小区域的帮助类\n• CJGRKit/CGRectCJAdjustHelper - 调整移动区域的帮助类\n\n• CJGRKit/Extension/KeepInBounds - UIView+CJKeepInBounds.h 限制本视图不移出其父视图或keyWindow\n• CJGRKit/Extension/FreeDrag - UIView+CJFreeDrag.h 通过pan手势，任意方向自由拖动的视图\n• CJGRKit/Extension/PanDown - UIView+CJPanDown.h 下拉回弹的视图拖动\n• CJGRKit/Extension/GR - UIView+CJGR.h 给任意UIView添加独立的拖动、捏合缩放、旋转手势\n• CJGRKit/Extension/Corner - UIView+CJGRCorner.h 给任意UIView添加角按钮编辑层\n• CJGRKit/Extension/KeepCoveredBounds - UIView+CJKeepCoveredBounds.h 给可手势变换的视图叠加外方向 keep-bounds 约束（内容始终覆盖/包含住裁剪窗口、手势结束自动吸附）\n\n• CJGRKit/CJGRView - 继承系统并添加有手势的 UIView ，能够进行拖动、缩放等手势\n• CJGRKit/CJGRScrollView - 继承系统并添加有手势的 UIScrollView ，能够进行拖动、缩放等手势\n\n每个子库可独立引入，详见各子库描述。",
  "platforms": {
    "ios": "9.0"
  },
  "source": {
    "git": "https://github.com/dvlproad/CJGRKit.git",
    "tag": "CJGRKit_0.2.8"
  },
  "frameworks": "UIKit",
  "requires_arc": true,
  "subspecs": [
    {
      "name": "CGRectCJSubHelper",
      "source_files": "CJGRKit/CGRectCJSubHelper/*.{h,m}"
    },
    {
      "name": "CGRectCJAdjustHelper",
      "source_files": "CJGRKit/CGRectCJAdjustHelper/*.{h,m}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Extension",
      "subspecs": [
        {
          "name": "KeepInBounds",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/Extension/KeepBounds/UIView+CJKeepInBounds.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/CGRectCJAdjustHelper": []
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "FreeDrag",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/Extension/FreeDrag/**/*.{h,m}"
        },
        {
          "name": "PanDown",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/Extension/PanDown/**/*.{h,m}"
        },
        {
          "name": "GR",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/Extension/GR/**/*.{h,m}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Corner",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/Extension/Corner/**/*.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/Extension/GR": []
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "KeepCoveredBounds",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/Extension/KeepBounds/UIView+CJKeepCoveredBounds.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/Extension/GR": [],
            "CJGRKit/CGRectCJAdjustHelper": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CJGRView",
      "subspecs": [
        {
          "name": "Base",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/CJGRView/Base/**/*.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/CGRectCJAdjustHelper": []
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "BaseAdjustGRView",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/CJGRView/BaseAdjustGRView/**/*.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/CJGRView/Base": []
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "ImageAdjustGRView",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/CJGRView/ImageAdjustGRView/**/*.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/CJGRView/BaseAdjustGRView": [],
            "CJGRKit/CGRectCJSubHelper": []
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "MaskImageAdjustGRView",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/CJGRView/MaskImageAdjustGRView/**/*.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/CJGRView/ImageAdjustGRView": [],
            "UIPathCJHelper": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "CJGRScrollView",
      "subspecs": [
        {
          "name": "Base",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/CJGRScrollView/Base/**/*.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "Masonry": []
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Image",
          "source_files": "CJGRKit/CJGRScrollView/Image/**/*.{h,m}",
          "dependencies": {
            "CJGRKit/CJGRScrollView/Base": [],
            "CJGRKit/CGRectCJSubHelper": []
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
